#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:3
#: 4ae01b963b654a9abc363f00c3280859
msgid "有序合金原型（Ordered Alloy Prototype）"
msgstr "Ordered Alloy Prototype"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:5
#: 58891182ed814d7a9f1f8bc06b29ac13
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:7
#: 8badc3b8c91b4fdb8d39b3bb7e24be65
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:9
#: eec6823eee26487186aa61c2122e4e60
msgid ""
"生成带晶体学子晶格身份的周期结构，首批支持 A1/fcc、A2/bcc、A3/hcp、L1₂/A3B、"
"B2/AB 和 L1₀/AB。子晶格写入逐原子数组 `atoms.arrays[\"sublattice\"]`；它不会"
"占用 `group`，因此后续仍可独立添加磁序分层、奇偶层或区域标签。"
msgstr ""
"Generate periodic structures with explicit crystallographic sublattice "
"identity. Initial support covers A1/fcc, A2/bcc, A3/hcp, L1₂/A3B, B2/AB, and "
"L1₀/AB. Sublattices are stored in the per-atom array "
"`atoms.arrays[\"sublattice\"]` and do not consume `group`, so magnetic-order "
"layers, alternating layers, or region labels can still be added "
"independently downstream."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:11
#: f7f95b538d5a464a8468146cac0479a2
msgid ""
"这张卡只建立晶胞、周期边界、分数坐标和子晶格。元素占位可以先给真实元素，也可"
"以用 `X` 占位符，再交给 `Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy` 生成整数可实现的有序或"
"部分无序合金。"
msgstr ""
"This card creates only the cell, periodic boundaries, fractional "
"coordinates, and sublattices. Element occupancy may use real elements "
"immediately or the `X` placeholder, then pass to `Finite-Cell Alloy "
"Occupancy` to generate ordered or partially disordered alloys with "
"realizable integer counts."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:13
#: 432fb1bb17474ec9bc266dd6999ad9d3
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and equations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:15
#: e56583bc73d34ff0a692caf6eb6202d4
msgid ""
"每个有序原型由基胞矩阵、固定分数坐标和每个位点的子晶格标签共同定义。重复数为 "
"$(n_a,n_b,n_c)$ 时，"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:18
#: 743294fa7ac04470a6742cfa92f93828
msgid ""
"\n"
"N'=N_0n_an_bn_c,\\qquad\n"
"N'_\\lambda=N_{\\lambda,0}n_an_bn_c,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:23
#: b1b89672e0d140acaa3cbff071a9bac1
msgid ""
"其中 $N_0$ 是基胞总位点数，$N_{\\lambda,0}$ 是子晶格 $\\lambda$ 的基胞位点"
"数。 因此 L1₂ 的 A:B=3:1、B2 的 A:B=1:1 会在任何整数扩胞后严格保持。非立方 "
"A3/hcp 和 L1₀ 使用 $c=a(c/a)$。`sublattice` 标签表示位点身份；把 A、B 映射成"
"什么元素只是占位 赋值，不改变原型拓扑。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:28
#: 45aa0b36d89f47b48bb39399c8b5b34d
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:30
#: e3198c39e96f41a284dbb5ec304a55d2
msgid "场景：L1₂ 相测试误差高，但训练集中没有保留角点/面心身份"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: high test error for L1₂ phases, but corner/face-center identity "
"was not retained in the training set"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:32
#: 57eddf2074f34ff58ddbf45d337549ac
msgid ""
"模型在 A3B 型有序相上的力误差明显高于随机固溶体。原训练集把所有 fcc 位点混成"
"同一个集合，无法系统覆盖 A、B 子晶格分别无序化的局域环境。"
msgstr ""
"The model's force error for A3B ordered phases is much higher than for "
"random solid solutions. The original training set merged all fcc sites into "
"one set, so it could not systematically cover local environments where the A "
"and B sublattices are disordered independently."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:34
#: 18c28df2618d403bb84f0ccae567d3e2
msgid ""
"**输入：** 无需输入结构。 **目标：** 先生成 32 原子的 L1₂ 周期超胞，其中 A、"
"B 子晶格严格为 24:8。 **参数设置：** `原型`选择 `L1₂/A3B`，`晶格常数范围`填 "
"`[3.6,3.6,0.1]`， `子晶格元素`填 `A:X,B:X`，关闭自动扩胞并把`重复倍数`设为 "
"`[2,2,2]`， `最大原子数`设为 `32`。 **输出：** 一个 32 原子周期结构，"
"`sublattice` 中有 24 个 `A` 和 8 个 `B`。 **怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 下游分"
"别约束 A/B 占位并完成 DFT 标注后，按原型和子晶格无序程度切片比较能量/力误差；"
"不能只看混合后的总 RMSE。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:42
