msgid "`str`，默认 `\"L12/A3B\"`。选择晶体原型及其固定的分数坐标和子晶格拓扑。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `\"L12/A3B\"`. Selects the crystal prototype and its fixed "
"fractional coordinates and sublattice topology."

