msgid "晶格常数范围（a_range）"
msgstr "a_range"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:59
#: 4f65c6b2ff074925a3136dc269bb3cd8
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `[3.6, 3.6, 0.1]`，依次是晶格常数 `a` 的起"
"点、终点和步长，单位 Å。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float, float]`, default `[3.6, 3.6, 0.1]`; the start, stop, "
"and step of lattice constant `a`, in Å."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:61
#: b755a9a73d344e5bbd53d899ca882c56
msgid ""
"需要补体积响应时可扫描一段窄范围；只要一个结构时令起点等于终点。每个扫描点都"
"受 `最大输出数`（`max_outputs`）限制。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:63
#: 9ee66c1557fc40608c56571b2c2011cc
msgid "晶格轴比 c/a（covera）"
msgstr "covera"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:65
#: 47661cf9363a4c1fad863287745372e2
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 1.0。A3/hcp 和 L1₀ 使用该值设置 `晶格轴比 c/a`（`covera`）；立"
"方 A1、A2、L1₂、B2 固定使用 1，并在界面中禁用该输入，避免误以为它会生效。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:67
#: 893cfa1473c141ada01ab6dce30de0c2
msgid ""
"A3 常从理想密排值约 1.633 起步；L1₀ 则应使用目标体系的四方畸变范围。不要用这"
"个参数替代后续的系统应变扫描。"
msgstr ""
"For A3, the ideal close-packed value of about 1.633 is a common starting "
"point. For L1₀, use a tetragonal distortion range appropriate to the target "
"system. Do not use this parameter as a substitute for a systematic "
"downstream strain scan."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:69
#: 0717e757908048fab83bbef2d21aa5eb
msgid "子晶格元素（sublattice_elements）"
msgstr "sublattice_elements"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:71
#: 77b8f0c253e94a2f8197901758c6ff0f
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `\"A:X,B:X\"`。按 `标签:元素` 指定基胞占位，例如 `A:Fe,B:Al`；"
"`X` 表示尚未决定元素的占位符。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `\"A:X,B:X\"`. Assign basis occupancy as `label:element`, for "
"example `A:Fe,B:Al`; `X` means the element has not yet been chosen."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:73
#: 4a5d0dc2a6bd4d4a9e3b2d1e60708f4b
msgid ""
"元素选择不带材料先验：卡片不会假设过渡金属属于 A，也不会限制主族元素只能进入 "
"B。切换原型时，界面明确提示所需标签和基胞计数；单子晶格原型只显示 A，不再保留"
"一个当前不会使用的 B 配置。未知标签会明确报错。"
msgstr ""
"Element selection carries no material prior: the card does not assume "
"transition metals belong on A or restrict main-group elements to B. When the "
"prototype changes, the UI reports the required labels and basis counts. A "
"single-sublattice prototype shows only A instead of retaining an unused B "
"configuration. Unknown labels fail explicitly."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:75
#: f23f3cb243a841cd955c4850d6030506
msgid "自动扩胞（auto_supercell）"
msgstr "auto_supercell"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:77
#: ea73915097d444d08fed479c676bdfd1
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 true。开启后，在不超过 `最大原子数`（`max_atoms`）的前提下自动选"
"择三轴重复数。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:79
#: 7a1cbbed450f4253898df77f45d02d91
msgid ""
"自动模式适合快速得到接近预算的周期胞；需要固定 24:8、8:8 等可审计计数时，手动"
"重复通常更直观。"
msgstr ""
"Automatic mode is useful for quickly approaching the atom budget. For "
"auditable fixed counts such as 24:8 or 8:8, manual repeats are usually "
"clearer."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:81
#: debd95f2e11b4496b77b491075fa4953
msgid "最大原子数（max_atoms）"
msgstr "max_atoms"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:83
#: f01036e417484c4ab65d57db7de597a7
msgid "`int`，默认 128。每个输出结构允许的原子数硬上限。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 128. Hard upper bound on atoms in each output structure."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:85
#: 8213f8b612994d7185009b947e75d626
msgid ""
"如果基胞本身或手动 `重复倍数`（`rep`）超过这个上限，operation 直接抛出 "
"`ValueError`，不会偷偷缩小重复数或返回超预算结构。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:87
#: 283e6d718f434e0e8f3d18feeee12020
msgid "重复倍数（rep）"
msgstr "rep"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:89
#: 66061ab7bbbd4d7bb6a3109ffc2ad082
msgid ""
"`tuple[int, int, int]`，默认 `[2, 2, 2]`。手动模式下沿三个晶格矢量的重复数。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[int, int, int]`, default `[2, 2, 2]`. Manual repeat counts along the "
"three lattice vectors."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:91
#: 55eeab9fad964ca198485dc8837ef674
msgid ""
"生效条件：`auto_supercell=false`。L1₂ 的 `[2,2,2]` 正好得到 32 原子，其中 "
"A:B=24:8。"
msgstr ""
"Applies when `auto_supercell=false`. For L1₂, `[2,2,2]` produces exactly 32 "
"atoms with A:B=24:8."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:93
#: 23c20e2306984625b5837f7f5490f7a4
msgid "最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "max_outputs"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:95
#: df60dab6eb4640efab9dab9478b68286
msgid "`int`，默认 200。晶格常数扫描最多返回的结构数。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 200. Maximum structures returned by the lattice-constant scan."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:97
#: cec565639f5b48b79171af02fa931ad2
msgid ""
"扫描范围很密时，它是独立于原子数的第二道预算门；达到上限后按 `晶格常数范围`"
"（`a_range`）的确定顺序停止。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:99
#: f4b0098666c64e07bc9d905ba6460beb
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:101
#: d86c426f1f6c4f89832ce58b416bf455
msgid "L1₂ 32 原子占位模板"
msgstr "L1₂ 32-atom occupancy template"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:103
#: aa4dba584ddf48ec83458946d7ab87b1
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"OrderedAlloyPrototypeCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"prototype\": \"L12/A3B\",\n"
"    \"a_range\": [3.6, 3.6, 0.1],\n"
"    \"covera\": 1.0,\n"
"    \"sublattice_elements\": \"A:X,B:X\",\n"
