msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:139
#: 8196cffce8194f3db842372aabc34200
msgid ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`：先锁定晶体学子晶格，"
"再按每个子晶格的整数计数生成占位。"
msgstr ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`: first fix "
"crystallographic sublattices, then generate occupancy from integer counts on "
"each sublattice."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:140
#: 1875da0230ff4dd5b79138da10fd7a6d
msgid ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Lattice Strain → Atomic Perturb`：补有序相的应变和"
"局域振动环境。"
msgstr ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Lattice Strain → Atomic Perturb`: add strain and "
"local vibrational environments to the ordered phase."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:141
#: 5ed268ec852c4a5b9f4cfb006cae26da
msgid ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Magnetic Order`：晶体学 `sublattice` 与磁性 "
"`group` 分开保存，再独立构造磁序。"
msgstr ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Magnetic Order`: keep crystallographic "
"`sublattice` separate from magnetic `group`, then construct magnetic order "
"independently."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:143
#: 4c224e6a4678452b85949042655b2ad0
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:145
#: 8b9e4ac64fc749cf8172f87f71f6293a
msgid ""
"**提示未知子晶格标签。** 首批原型只使用 A/B；占位映射可同时保留 A、B 方便切换"
"原型，但不能写任意新标签。"
msgstr ""
"**The card reports an unknown sublattice label.** Initial prototypes use "
"only A/B. The occupancy mapping may retain both A and B to support prototype "
"switching, but it cannot introduce arbitrary new labels."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:147
#: 8840fe056fc8415699515ea151a6e17d
msgid ""
"**手动超胞超过 `最大原子数`（`max_atoms`）。** 卡片会明确失败，不会改变用户给"
"出的重复数。调小 `重复倍数`（`rep`）或提高原子数预算。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:149
#: dc2b66ff69364818ba6785f56a78e247
msgid ""
"**为什么没有弛豫。** 本卡只生成几何原型。弛豫、势函数调用、LAMMPS、chemical "
"MC 和 DFT 提交不属于该卡职责。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is there no relaxation?** This card only generates a geometric "
"prototype. Relaxation, potential evaluation, LAMMPS, chemical MC, and DFT "
"submission are outside its scope."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:151
#: 760819ac04bf4013ae09556574fbab4f
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:153
#: dab7fb1f35434f7d8eec03c45bac5fbf
msgid ""
"`Config_type` 追加 `OrderedProto(<prototype>,a=<a>,rep=<na>x<nb>x<nc>)`。"
"`ordered_alloy_prototype` metadata 记录原型、晶格参数、重复数、子晶格元素和实"
"际子晶格计数。"
msgstr ""
"`Config_type` appends `OrderedProto(<prototype>,a=<a>,rep=<na>x<nb>x<nc>)`. "
"The `ordered_alloy_prototype` metadata records the prototype, lattice "
"parameters, repeat counts, sublattice elements, and realized sublattice "
"counts."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:155
#: ad307e4598b14a4686583278c379fd1f
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/ordered-alloy-prototype-card.md:157
#: 2114533667d44766aaeaa2c007aee6fb
msgid ""
"本卡没有随机采样。同一组参数总是得到相同的 cell、PBC、分数坐标、元素和 "
"`sublattice` 数组。"
msgstr ""
"This card performs no random sampling. The same parameters always produce "
"identical cell, PBC, fractional coordinates, elements, and `sublattice` "
"array."

#~ msgid "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `OrderedAlloyPrototypeCard`"
#~ msgstr "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `OrderedAlloyPrototypeCard`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输入：** 无需输入结构。 **目标：** 先生成 32 原子的 L1₂ 周期超胞，其中 "
#~ "A、B 子晶格严格为 24:8。 **参数设置：** `prototype=\"L12/A3B\"`，"
#~ "`a_range=[3.6,3.6,0.1]`，`sublattice_elements=\"A:X,B:X\"`，手动 "
#~ "`rep=[2,2,2]`，`max_atoms=32`。 **输出：** 一个 32 原子周期结构，"
#~ "`sublattice` 中有 24 个 `A` 和 8 个 `B`。 **怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 下"
#~ "游分别约束 A/B 占位并完成 DFT 标注后，按原型和子晶格无序程度切片比较能量/"
#~ "力误差；不能只看混合后的总 RMSE。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** none. **Goal:** first generate a periodic 32-atom L1₂ "
#~ "supercell with a strict A:B sublattice ratio of 24:8. **Parameters:** "
#~ "`prototype=\"L12/A3B\"`, `a_range=[3.6,3.6,0.1]`, "
#~ "`sublattice_elements=\"A:X,B:X\"`, manual `rep=[2,2,2]`, and "
#~ "`max_atoms=32`. **Output:** one periodic 32-atom structure whose "
#~ "`sublattice` array contains 24 `A` and 8 `B` entries. **How to verify "
#~ "improved training-set quality:** after constraining A/B occupancies "
#~ "downstream and obtaining DFT labels, compare energy and force errors in "
#~ "slices by prototype and sublattice disorder. Do not rely only on the "
#~ "aggregate RMSE."

#~ msgid "Prototype（prototype）"
#~ msgstr "Prototype（prototype）"

#~ msgid "Lattice Range（a_range）"
#~ msgstr "Lattice Range（a_range）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "需要补体积响应时可扫描一段窄范围；只要一个结构时令起点等于终点。每个扫描点"
#~ "都受 `max_outputs` 限制。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Scan a narrow range when volume response is needed. Set start equal to "
#~ "stop when only one structure is required. Every scan point is subject to "
#~ "`max_outputs`."

#~ msgid "c/a（covera）"
#~ msgstr "c/a（covera）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 1.0。A3/hcp 和 L1₀ 使用该值设置 `c/a`；立方 A1、A2、L1₂、B2 "
#~ "固定使用 1，并在界面中禁用该输入，避免误以为它会生效。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default 1.0. A3/hcp and L1₀ use this value for `c/a`; cubic A1, "
#~ "A2, L1₂, and B2 fix it at 1 and disable the input in the UI so it cannot "
#~ "appear effective when it is not."

#~ msgid "Sublattice Elements（sublattice_elements）"
#~ msgstr "Sublattice Elements（sublattice_elements）"

#~ msgid "Auto Supercell（auto_supercell）"
#~ msgstr "Auto Supercell（auto_supercell）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 true。开启后，在不超过 `max_atoms` 的前提下自动选择三轴重复"
#~ "数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default true. When enabled, the card automatically chooses three-"
#~ "axis repeat counts without exceeding `max_atoms`."

#~ msgid "Max Atoms（max_atoms）"
#~ msgstr "Max Atoms（max_atoms）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果基胞本身或手动 `rep` 超过这个上限，operation 直接抛出 `ValueError`，不"
#~ "会偷偷缩小重复数或返回超预算结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If the basis itself or manual `rep` exceeds this bound, the operation "
#~ "raises `ValueError` instead of silently reducing repeat counts or "
#~ "returning an over-budget structure."

#~ msgid "Rep（rep）"
#~ msgstr "Rep（rep）"

#~ msgid "Max Outputs（max_outputs）"
#~ msgstr "Max Outputs（max_outputs）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "扫描范围很密时，它是独立于原子数的第二道预算门；达到上限后按 `a_range` 的"
#~ "确定顺序停止。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "For a dense scan, this is a second budget gate independent of atom count. "
#~ "Once reached, the scan stops in deterministic `a_range` order."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**手动超胞超过 `max_atoms`。** 卡片会明确失败，不会改变用户给出的重复数。"
#~ "调小 `rep` 或提高原子数预算。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The manual supercell exceeds `max_atoms`.** The card fails explicitly "
#~ "and does not change the requested repeat counts. Reduce `rep` or raise "
#~ "the atom budget."
